# 1Password JavaScript SDK v0.0.0-credential-broker-dev-preview.1

> **Dev preview.** No backwards-compatibility guarantees.

## NEW

- `accessRequests.create` now returns an app link (`appLink`) that opens the approval prompt in the 1Password app.

## BREAKING CHANGES

- `accessRequests.create` now returns `AccessRequestCreateResponse` (`{ accessRequest, appLink }`) instead of `AccessRequest`.
- `logins.read`, `logins.getDetails`, and `environmentVariables.read` now take the credential reference as a plain string. The `CredentialReference` type was removed.
- `website` is now required in access request entry parameters.
